VALUES ('747fd373-3cca-4fc5-a848-9e9b2bd94a25', '16.95 CT’s natural neon hot pink rubilite tourmaline from Afghanistan', 'This stunning 16.75 -carat vivid pink Rubellite Tourmaline is a rare collector’s gemstone with an intense, vibrant color. Its electrifying pink hue makes it a showstopper, ideal for high-end jewelry or gemstone investment. The stone exhibits natural inclusions, adding to its authenticity and unique character.
	•	Weight: 16.75CT
	•	Shape: Custom Cushion Cut
	•	Color: Neon Pink
	•	Clarity: Included (Natural Inclusions )
	•	Origin: Afghanistan 
